(** #dev/identify's « Couche d'identification (rejeu) » block: opens
    {!Screens.Identify} over the page with services that replay the recorded
    Pl@ntNet answers (Identify_fixtures, generated by this directory's dune from
    test/fixtures/) through [Herbier_identify.Make (Replay_transport)], a
    TRANSPORT with ['a io = 'a Fut.t] and [image = Brr.Blob.t] that answers
    after 1200 ms (so 6b and its 600 ms label show). Nothing reaches the network
    or the store.

    A checkbox « Appelant : fiche nom libre (6k) » picks the caller of the
    layers opened next: unticked [Observation] (4h), ticked [Free_name] of a
    synthetic id made once per page (not the collection plant's, which then
    shows as « Aussi dans ma collection »; « Lier » on every card; 6g with «
    Retour »).

    One button per state, each opening the layer (the caller above, one or two
    {!Kit.test_jpeg} previews, organs [Auto]); « + <organe> » adds a new test
    JPEG at once; the gate is a constant [Ready] of the fake key ["rejeu"]; the
    flora is a local signal that « Flore » changes; the flora list replays
    [projects_fr_200]; the collection is one synthetic plant with the GBIF key
    of [two_flower_leaf_200]'s first proposal and two observations of it.
    - « 6b envoi »: an answer that never comes;
    - « 6c propositions » (2 photos): [two_flower_leaf_200];
    - « 6f incertaines »: [one_auto_200];
    - « 6g aucune plante »: [not_plant_404], with [no-reject=true]
      [not_plant_no_reject_404];
    - « 6g injoignable »: the transport's [Timeout];
    - « 6g clé non exposée »: 403 with [origin_refused_403]'s body;
    - « 6g requête refusée »: 413, empty body;
    - « 6g quota »: 429, empty body;
    - « 6g clé refusée »: [invalid_key_401].

    Re-asks replay the same scenario. Each request logs Make's line to the
    block's log and the console, prefixed [rejeu: ] (Make's line never holds the
    key nor the URL). Closing logs [fermé : <outcome>] ([Left], [Chosen <name>],
    [None_matches]) and the photos' count. *)

val el : unit -> Brr.El.t
